{
  "version": 1,
  "description": "Residual-closure evidence contract (spec \u00a713.3). The single source of truth read by both scripts/run-residual-closure.sh and the final artifact gate. Every required artifact must actually be created by the pipeline (\u00a713.4): suites with proof=cargo_exit require a non-empty log + cargo exit 0 + parsed failed count 0; suites with proof=jsonl additionally require the exact emitted records listed in required_records. No nonexistent JSONL may be required and no missing JSON may be synthesized.",
